{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents7OUDSTagV","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSTag","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTag"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSTag","kind":"identifier"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTag"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tags have two appearances so as to highlight or not their content:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"emphasized"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag with a solid, high-contrast background. Used to draw strong attention to important","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"labels or categories. Emphasized tags stand out prominently against the interface and are ideal for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"primary or high-priority information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"muted","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag with a subtle, light, or semi-transparent background. Used for secondary or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"less prominent information. Muted tags blend more with the background, providing a softer visual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"emphasis compared to emphasized tags.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Status","anchor":"Status","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tags have seven status depending on the context of the information they represent. Each state is designed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to convey a specific meaning and ensure clarity in communication.","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Default or inactive state. Used for standard labels, categories, or when no specific","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status needs to be communicated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Used to draw attention to new features, recommendations, or content suggestions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Invites users to explore and engage with new offerings, creating an exciting and engaging experience.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Indicates success, confirmation, or a positive status. Commonly used to highlight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completed actions or approved items.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Signals caution or a potentially risky situation. Used to draw attention to items","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requiring user awareness or intervention.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Represents errors, critical issues, or urgent attention needed. Used to highlight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"problems or failed actions.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Conveys informational messages or supplementary details. Used for neutral, helpful,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or contextual information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Disabled","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Shows that the tag is inactive and cannot be interacted with. Appears faded or greyed out. This is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"allowed when loader is activated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Shape","anchor":"Shape","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tags can have two shapes:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rounded","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag with fully rounded corners, creating a pill-shaped appearance. Rounded","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tags offer a softer and more approachable look, suitable for most modern interfaces.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Square","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag with sharp, square corners. Squared tags provide a more formal, structured, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technical feel. They are often used in business contexts to label promotions, offers, or important notices.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Size","anchor":"Size","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tags can have two sizes:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Default","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The standard tag size, suitable for most use cases and offering good readability.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Small","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A compact tag with reduced height and font size. Used when saving space is important or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when grouping elements visually.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There are four available layouts for tags:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"-","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text only","type":"text"}]},{"text":": A tag that displays only text. Used for simple labels, categories, or keywords without additional visual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"elements.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"-","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text + Bullet","type":"text"}]},{"text":": A tag with a small indicator (dot) alongside the text. Used to show status, presence, or activity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next to the label.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"-","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text + Icon","type":"text"}]},{"text":": A tag that includes an icon before the text. Used to visually reinforce the meaning of the tag,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as status, type, or action.","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Text + Loader","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag that combines a loading spinner (or progress indicator) with text. Used to indicate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a process or action related to the tag is in progress.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Text only with neutral status, for emphasized appearance with rounded shape in default size","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\",  status: .neutral(), appearance: .emphasized, shape: .rounded, size: .default)","    \/\/ Or also","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\")","    \/\/ Or from a localizale and a bundle","    OUDSTag(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(leading: .bullet)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with a custom decorative icon","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"))))","    \/\/ If your layout is in RTL mode but your tag has an icon with another meaning because of bad orientation,","    \/\/ you can flip the icon using OUDSImage.flipped","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), flipped: true)))","    \/\/ If you want to display a raw image (not tinted), use renderingMode: .original","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original)))","","    \/\/ Text with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(bullet: true))","","    \/\/ Tag with indeterminate circular progress indicator, with rounded shape in small size","    OUDSTag(loadingLabel: \"Processing...\", shape: .rounded, size: .small)","","    \/\/ Tag with determinate circular progress indicator, with rounded shape in default size","    OUDSTag(loadingLabel: \"Processing...\", progress: 0.75)"]},{"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-tag"}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Orange"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_OrangeCompact"}]},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Sosh"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Wireframe"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.18.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstag"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tag is a UI element that allows to display short info like a label, keyword, or category."},{"type":"text","te